t_group_data helper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-13-telegram-cleaner.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "reset_group_data wipes blocked, whitelist, and stats while retaining the groups row."}, {"id": "plan_keyboards", "label": "keyboards module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-13-telegram-cleaner.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keyboard builders create inline group menus, type toggles, whitelist lists, and the native request_users picker."}, {"id": "plan_callback_protocol", "label": "Callback data protocol", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-13-telegram-cleaner.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exact callback prefixes include group, types, toggle, white, unwhite, stats, reset_stats, reset_group, back_groups, and noop."}, {"id": "plan_private_router", "label": "handlers_private router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-13-telegram-cleaner.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Private router handles /start, group lists, owner-gated menus, type toggles, stats, and reset commands."}, {"id": "plan_group_router", "label": "handlers_group router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-13-telegram-cleaner.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Group router deletes blocked non-whitelisted messages for groups and supergroups, handles edited messages, and throttles no-rights DMs."}, {"id": "plan_membership_router", "label": "handlers_membership router", "file_type":